# Derive Option Manager

## Configuration

Les parametres sont sauvegardes dans:
  ~/.derive-option-manager/settings.json

### Methode 1: Configuration interactive (recommandee)

```bash
npm run setup
```

### Methode 2: Edition manuelle du fichier

```bash
# Creer le repertoire
mkdir -p ~/.derive-option-manager

# Creer le fichier settings.json
cat > ~/.derive-option-manager/settings.json << 'EOF'
{
  "wsUrl": "wss://api.lyra.finance/ws/v2",
  "restUrl": "https://api.lyra.finance",
  "sessionKey": "0xTonAdresseSessionKey",
  "sessionSecret": "0xTaClePriveeSessionKey",
  "subaccountId": 0,
  "breakEvenOffsetPct": 0.5,
  "pollIntervalMs": 5000,
  "logLevel": "info"
}
EOF
```

## Lancement

```bash
# Verifier la configuration
npm run setup

# Lancer l'application
npm run dev
```
